<h2>JULY 2026</h2>

<div class="day"><b>15/07/2026 — Wednesday (Day 1 — Reporting)</b>
<ul>
<li>Reported for industrial attachment at RRA and met industry supervisor Ivan BISENGIMANA.</li>
<li>Completed orientation in the IT and Digital Transformation department.</li>
<li>Received the Meeting Room Management System assignment and project brief.</li>
<li>Installed JDK 21, Maven, Node.js, PostgreSQL and VS Code on the workstation.</li>
<li>Cloned/opened the project workspace and reviewed existing folder structure.</li>
</ul></div>

<div class="day"><b>16/07/2026 — Thursday</b>
<ul>
<li>Studied how staff currently request and use meeting rooms at RRA.</li>
<li>Listed functional requirements: login, rooms, bookings, admin approval, holidays.</li>
<li>Listed non-functional requirements: security, no double booking, role-based access.</li>
<li>Drew a first draft of system actors: Admin and User.</li>
<li>Researched Spring Boot 3 and React as the chosen tech stack.</li>
</ul></div>

<div class="day"><b>17/07/2026 — Friday</b>
<ul>
<li>Reviewed backend and frontend folders in the project repository.</li>
<li>Planned database tables: users, rooms, bookings, holidays.</li>
<li>Prepared an 8-week development schedule with the supervisor.</li>
<li>Documented local environment needs: Java 21, PostgreSQL port 5433, API port 8082.</li>
<li>Set up Git and agreed on daily logbook recording at the workplace.</li>
</ul></div>

