<li>Started notes for the attachment report introduction section.</li>
</ul></div>

<div class="day"><b>23/07/2026 — Thursday</b>
<ul>
<li>Met supervisor to confirm booking business rules for RRA.</li>
<li>Documented rule: no bookings on Saturday or Sunday.</li>
<li>Documented rule: no bookings on Rwanda public holidays.</li>
<li>Documented rule: no overlapping bookings on the same room and time.</li>
<li>Documented rule: all new bookings start as PENDING until admin approval.</li>
</ul></div>

